<!--
  PRODUCT_SPEC PLAY-002 — *put the book in the car*, in the Android Auto player and the media notification.

  Material's `directions_car_filled`, which is the glyph Android Auto itself uses for a car and therefore
  the one a driver reads without deciding what it is. Filled rather than outlined, and without the interior
  detail an outline would carry: a head unit tints and scales these, and detail is the first thing to go at
  a glance from a driving position. `@android:color/white` and a 24dp box are Media3's own conventions for
  the icons it ships for this slot, so the button sits with the others rather than beside them.
-->
